             SECTION: TRANSMISSION CHAMBER & FOLLOWERS
             ===================================================== -->
    <hr class="p5-sep" />
    <div class="p5-section-label">Transmission Chamber Architecture</div>
    <h2 class="p5-section-title">Follower piston integration and crankshaft coupling</h2>

    <div class="p5-subsystem-grid">
        <div class="p5-subsystem-card">
            <h3>Follower Piston Assembly (×2)</h3>
            <ul class="p5-spec-list">
                <li><strong>Piston type:</strong> Rolling follower (needle bearing contact)</li>
                <li><strong>Motion input:</strong> Rotary lobe from converter wheel</li>
                <li><strong>Output motion:</strong> Reciprocating linear (pushes main crankshaft)</li>
                <li><strong>Stroke length:</strong> 40 mm (matched to wheel lobe throw)</li>
                <li><strong>Engagement force:</strong> Spring-loaded return (rate 15 N/mm)</li>
                <li><strong>Bearing preload:</strong> Maintained at ~50 N to eliminate lost motion</li>
                <li><strong>Friction loss:</strong> ~3–5% of transmitted power (rolling contact)</li>
                <li><strong>Lubrication:</strong> Grease-packed sealed bearings (NLGI #2)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p5-subsystem-card">
            <h3>Crankshaft Coupling</h3>
            <ul class="p5-spec-list">
                <li><strong>Coupling type:</strong> Scotch yoke or slider-crank mechanism</li>
                <li><strong>Input sources:</strong> Both follower pistons (synchronized)</li>
                <li><strong>Output:</strong> Continuous rotational motion (0–5000 RPM)</li>
                <li><strong>Phase relationship:</strong> Followers operate 180° out of phase (smooth torque)</li>
                <li><strong>Torque at rated pressure (100 PSI):</strong> τ = F × r = (503 lbf) × (2 in) ≈ 1,006 ft-lbf per cycle</li>
                <li><strong>Continuous power output:</strong> At 3000 RPM: P = (1,006 ft-lbf × 3000 RPM) / 5252 ≈ 575 hp (peak)</li>
                <li><strong>Rated power (sustainable):</strong> ~350 hp  3000 RPM, 100 PSI</li>
                <li><strong>Damping:</strong> Torsional vibration isolator (elastomer ring)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p5-subsystem-card">
            <h3>Transmission Output Shaft</h3>
            <ul class="p5-spec-list">
                <li><strong>Drive type:</strong> Standard automatic transmission input</li>
                <li><strong>Torque rating:</strong> 1,000+ ft-lbf (compatible with heavy-duty slushbox)</li>
                <li><strong>Speed range:</strong> 0–5000 RPM continuous (limited by pressure availability)</li>
                <li><strong>Connection:</strong> Flexible coupling to transmission bell housing</li>
                <li><strong>Fluid cooler:</strong> Integral to condensate recovery loop (heat rejection)</li>
                <li><strong>Filter:</strong> 10 micron spin-on (maintains fluid cleanliness for longevity)</li>
                <li><strong>Service interval:</strong> 100,000 miles (fluid + filter change)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p5-subsystem-card">
            <h3>Pressure Tank & Condensate Recovery</h3>
            <ul class="p5-spec-list">
                <li><strong>Tank capacity:</strong> 25 gallons (94.6 L)</li>
                <li><strong>Material:</strong> Seamless steel, ASME pressure vessel certified</li>
                <li><strong>Max working pressure:</strong> 150 PSI (safety factor 4.0)</li>
                <li><strong>Relief valve setting:</strong> 165 PSI (pop-off safety)</li>
                <li><strong>Condensate inlet:</strong> Gravity return from transmission chamber condenser</li>
                <li><strong>Water treatment:</strong> Inline demineralizer cartridge (prevents scale buildup)</li>
                <li><strong>Level sensor:</strong> Capacitive float + backup mechanical gauge</li>
                <li><strong>Low-level alarm:</strong> PCW triggers warning at 30% full; shutdown at 10%</li>
                <li><strong>Filler cap:</strong> Twist-locking with silica-gel desiccant breather</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

